    <briefdescription>
<para>These routines set the axis specifications associated with the global domains. The domain is a derived type with private elements. These routines set the axis specifications associated with the global domains. The 2D version of these is a simple extension of 1D. <linebreak/>
Example usage: </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>call mpp_set_global_domain(domain_1d, isg, ieg) call mpp_set_global_domain(domain_2d, isg, ieg, jsg, jeg) </para>    </detaileddescription>
